========================================================================
  VERIFICATION 7: True information content of shadow
========================================================================

  How many bits of H-information does the shadow carry?
  H-entropy = entropy of H distribution
  Conditional H-entropy = average entropy of H given scores
  Information = H-entropy - conditional H-entropy

  n=3: m = 3 arc-bits
    H-entropy = 0.8113 bits
    H|scores-entropy = 0.0000 bits
    Mutual information I(H; scores) = 0.8113 bits
    Fraction of H-info captured = 1.0000

  n=4: m = 6 arc-bits
    H-entropy = 1.5613 bits
    H|scores-entropy = 0.0000 bits
    Mutual information I(H; scores) = 1.5613 bits
    Fraction of H-info captured = 1.0000

  n=5: m = 10 arc-bits
    H-entropy = 2.6810 bits
    H|scores-entropy = 0.3962 bits
    Mutual information I(H; scores) = 2.2849 bits
    Fraction of H-info captured = 0.8522

  n=6: m = 15 arc-bits
